OL,3,ATech stocks fall after calls for AI
OL,4,Adevelopment to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FTech stocks in Asia and Europe fall
OL,7,Fafter the bosses of artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI) companies called for
OL,9,Fa slow down in the pace of its
OL,10,Fdevelopment
OL,12,FThe head of AI company Anthropic, Dario
OL,13,FAmodei, said on Saturday the pace of
OL,14,Fdevelopment should be slowed "to reduce
OL,15,Fthe risk that something goes seriously
OL,16,Fwrong"
OL,18,FGrok founder Elon Musk said Amodoei was
OL,19,F"right", while OpenAI CEO Sam Altman
OL,20,Fsaid standards are "not at a place" to
OL,21,Fpush AI capabilities much further
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
