OL,3,ATech stocks fall after calls for AI
OL,4,Adevelopment to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Jacob Coxon, a
OL,7,Fresearcher who quit Anthropic, told the
OL,8,FBBC staff developing AI systems were
OL,9,F"genuinely frightened" for the future
OL,10,Fof humanity
OL,12,FUS President Donald Trump has
OL,13,Fdownplayed the threat, saying "whoever
OL,14,Fwins AI, wins"; China's foreign
OL,15,Fministry spokesperson says "all parties
OL,16,Fshould work together to foster an AI
OL,17,Flandscape that is open, inclusive,
OL,18,Funiversally beneficial"
